Changes to the testfadc program.

24 Jan 01	version 1.2	Marty O.
	Changes for new clock board.

19 Dec 00	version 1.1	Marty O.
	testfadc.c: print message ("nuttin' honey) if we don't get data
	    when expected. Straightened out the enable, disable, wr_mode,
	    and evt clear sequences.

 4 Dec 00	version 1.0	Marty O.
	libfadc.h: new macro FADC_MAXBOARDS gives max. no. of FADC in the
	    bus.
	libfadc.c: bug in determining the offset from WinBase when less
	    than the max. number of boards installed.
	testfadc.c: code cleanup

 1 Dec 00	Marty O.
	Starting with the testfadc program by Karl Kosack dated 27 Oct 00.
	    Using his libfadc.[ch] with the same date.
	libfadc.c
	    New routine fadc_bd_init() allows the system to be run with
		just one board. The vme address space is assumed to have
		room for 3 fadc boards, but only one board is assumed to be
		present.
	libfadc.h
	    Prototype for fadc_bd_init().
	fadc.h
	    FADC_NCHAN macro.
	testfadc.c
	    Changes for dealing with just one board.
